      629.53,
      295.07,
      688.6
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of Land in F.V.P. 172, Supplement No. 409, SheetNo. 450 prepared by the superintend surveyor in Monaragala,situated in Muppane Village in the Moneragala DivisionalSecretary's Division of the District of Monaragala in UvaProvince described as follows :",
