  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.53,
      509.53,
      547.77,
      604.6
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyagents duly authorized in writing, before me at MoneragalaDivisional Secretariat on the 29th day of October, 2019 at 10.00a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the 15th day of October, 2019 the natureof their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the said land the amount of compensationand the details of the computation of such amount.",
